---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout page="privacy">
<main
  id="main-content"
  class="privacy-page">
  <div class="privacy-container">
    <section
      class="privacy-card privacy-intro"
      aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
      <p class="section-kicker">
        Privacy &amp; Data Use
      </p>
      <h1 id="privacy-title">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="privacy-updated">
        Last Updated:
        <time datetime="2026-10-28">October 28, 2026</time>
      </p>
      <p>
        RGE Solutions respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains
        what information may be collected when you visit rgesol.com,
        submit an inquiry, or interact with services linked from this
        website. It also explains how that information may be used and
        the choices available to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website is intended to provide information about RGE
        Solutions, its technology advisory services, and its professional
        experience. Personal and business information submitted through
        the website is used to respond to inquiries, evaluate potential
        engagements, maintain professional communications, and operate
        the website.
      </p>
      <p>
        This policy explains our practices. Optional Google Analytics cookies
        are used only after you choose to allow them.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="information-collected-title">
      <h2 id="information-collected-title">
        Information We Collect
      </h2>
      <h3>
        Information You Provide
      </h3>
      <p>
        If you contact RGE Solutions through the website, by email, by
        telephone, through LinkedIn, or through another professional
        communication channel, we may collect information that you
        voluntarily provide, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Telephone number</li>
        <li>Company or organization</li>
        <li>Job title or professional role</li>
        <li>Preferred method of communication</li>
        <li>Information about your organization or technology needs</li>
        <li>Information included in your message or inquiry</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Please do not submit confidential, proprietary, regulated, or
        highly sensitive information through the website contact form.
        Submission of an inquiry does not create a client, advisory,
        fiduciary, or other professional relationship.
      </p>
      <h3>
        Automatically Collected Information
      </h3>
      <p>
        Like most websites, certain technical and usage information may
        be collected automatically when you visit the site. This may
        include:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Internet Protocol address</li>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Device and operating-system information</li>
        <li>Pages visited</li>
        <li>Date and time of your visit</li>
        <li>Time spent on pages</li>
        <li>Referring website or source</li>
        <li>General geographic information derived from your connection</li>
        <li>Diagnostic, performance, and security information</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This information helps us understand how the website is used,
        evaluate website performance, improve usability, and protect the
        website from misuse or security threats.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="cookies-title">
      <h2 id="cookies-title">
        Cookies and Similar Technologies
      </h2>
      <p>
        Cloudflare provides hosting, security, and cookie-free traffic and
        performance analytics. Google Analytics uses optional cookies to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Measure website traffic and engagement</li>
        <li>Understand how visitors navigate the website</li>
        <li>Remember basic preferences where applicable</li>
        <li>Evaluate website performance and functionality</li>
        <li>Detect misuse and support website security</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Google Analytics loads only after you select “Allow cookies.” Declining
        or dismissing the small notice leaves Google Analytics off. You can
        change your choice through “Privacy choices” in the footer. We remember
        your choice in your browser for up to 180 days. Advertising features are
        disabled, and we do not send contact-form contents to analytics providers.
      </p>
      <p>
        Essential, temporary form-security cookies and rate-limit records help
        prevent misuse. These are separate from optional analytics cookies.
        The form uses a hashed connection address for rate limiting; it does not
        attempt to identify a person or physical address from an IP address.
        Our hosting provider still processes network information to serve and
        secure requests. Staging and local previews do not load Google Analytics.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="information-use-title">
      <h2 id="information-use-title">
        How Information Is Used
      </h2>
      <p>
        Information collected through or in connection with this
        website may be used to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to inquiries and requests</li>
        <li>Evaluate potential consulting or advisory engagements</li>
        <li>Schedule and conduct professional communications</li>
        <li>Provide requested information about RGE Solutions</li>
        <li>Maintain business and professional records</li>
        <li>Improve website performance and usability</li>
        <li>Analyze website traffic and engagement</li>
        <li>Monitor website security and prevent misuse</li>
        <li>Comply with legal, regulatory, or contractual obligations</li>
        <li>Protect the rights and interests of RGE Solutions and others</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <strong>
          RGE Solutions does not sell personal information.
        </strong>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="third-party-title">
      <h2 id="third-party-title">
        Third-Party Services
      </h2>
      <p>
        RGE Solutions may use trusted third-party services to operate,
        secure, measure, and support this website and its professional
        communications. Depending on the services and features used,
        these providers may include:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Google Analytics</li>
        <li>Google Search Console</li>
        <li>Cloudflare hosting, security, delivery, and cookie-free Web Analytics</li>
        <li>Resend for delivery of contact-form messages to RGE Solutions</li>
        <li>LinkedIn</li>
        <li>Email and communication service providers</li>
        <li>Contact-form processing or anti-spam services</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Contact-form messages are sent to tim@rgesol.com. Resend processes the
        message and delivery metadata; RGE Solutions receives the inquiry in its
        mailbox. The website does not maintain a database of submitted messages.
        Form-security records expire separately, and application error logs omit
        message contents and credentials.
      </p>
      <p>
        These providers may process limited information according to
        their own privacy policies, terms, and security practices.
        RGE Solutions does not control the privacy practices of
        third-party websites or service providers.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="sharing-title">
      <h2 id="sharing-title">
        How Information May Be Shared
      </h2>
      <p>
        Information may be disclosed to service providers or
        professional advisors when reasonably necessary to operate the
        website, respond to an inquiry, protect the website, maintain
        business records, or comply with applicable obligations.
      </p>
      <p>
        Information may also be disclosed when reasonably believed to
        be necessary to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Comply with applicable law or a valid legal request</li>
        <li>Protect the rights or property of RGE Solutions</li>
        <li>Investigate suspected fraud, misuse, or security incidents</li>
        <li>Protect the safety of website users or the public</li>
        <li>Establish, exercise, or defend legal claims</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="retention-title">
      <h2 id="retention-title">
        Data Retention
      </h2>
      <p>
        Information submitted through the website or provided through
        professional communications is retained only for as long as
        reasonably necessary to respond to inquiries, evaluate or
        support potential engagements, maintain appropriate business
        records, satisfy legal or contractual obligations, resolve
        disputes, or protect the security of the website.
      </p>
      <p>
        Technical and website-usage information may be retained for a
        shorter or longer period depending on security, analytical,
        operational, and legal requirements.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="security-title">
      <h2 id="security-title">
        Data Security
      </h2>
      <p>
        RGE Solutions uses reasonable administrative and technical
        measures intended to protect information submitted through this
        website against unauthorized access, loss, misuse, or
        disclosure.
      </p>
      <p>
        However, no method of transmitting information over the
        Internet or storing electronic information can be guaranteed
        to be completely secure. Information submitted electronically
        is provided at your own risk.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="rights-title">
      <h2 id="rights-title">
        Your Privacy Choices and Rights
      </h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have the
        right to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request access to personal information held about you</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
        <li>Request deletion of personal information</li>
        <li>Object to or restrict certain processing</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
        <li>Request information about how your data is used or disclosed</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        RGE Solutions may need to verify your identity before completing
        a request. Certain information may be retained when required or
        permitted by law or when necessary for legitimate business,
        security, recordkeeping, or legal purposes.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="external-links-title">
      <h2 id="external-links-title">
        External Links
      </h2>
      <p>
        This website contains links to third-party websites and
        professional platforms, including LinkedIn and other external
        services.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you follow an external link, the destination website
        operates under its own privacy policy and terms. RGE Solutions
        is not responsible for the content, availability, security, or
        privacy practices of third-party websites.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="children-title">
      <h2 id="children-title">
        Children’s Privacy
      </h2>
      <p>
        This website and the services of RGE Solutions are intended for
        businesses and adult professionals. The website is not directed
        to children, and RGE Solutions does not knowingly solicit or
        collect personal information from children under 13.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you believe a child has submitted personal information
        through this website, please contact RGE Solutions so the
        information can be reviewed and, where appropriate, deleted.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card"
      aria-labelledby="changes-title">
      <h2 id="changes-title">
        Changes to This Privacy Policy
      </h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect
        changes in website functionality, service providers, business
        practices, or legal requirements.
      </p>
      <p>
        The “Last Updated” date at the top of this page identifies when
        the policy was most recently revised. Changes become effective
        when the updated policy is posted on this page.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="privacy-card privacy-contact"
      aria-labelledby="privacy-contact-title">
      <h2 id="privacy-contact-title">
        Contact RGE Solutions
      </h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this Privacy Policy or requests concerning
        personal information may be submitted to:
      </p>
      <address>
        <strong>
          RGE Solutions LLC        </strong>
        <br />
        Email:
        <a href="mailto:timgabaree@rgesol.com">
          timgabaree@rgesol.com        </a>
        <br />
        Telephone:
        <a href="tel:+15712100586">
          571.210.0586        </a>
      </address>
      <p>
        You may also submit a message through the
        <a href="/contact">
          RGE Solutions contact page
        </a>.
      </p>
    </section>
   </div>
</main>
</Layout>
